OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA generally
OL,6,Fdry evening to come with some bright
OL,7,Fspells. Cloud is expected to thicken
OL,8,Fand lower overnight, particularly over
OL,9,Fthe Pennines. Some clearer spells
OL,10,Fstill possible. Staying mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FAny low cloud first thing
OL,13,Fwill start to lift during the morning,
OL,14,Fbringing bright and sunny spells for
OL,15,Fmany. Risk of thunderstorms developing
OL,16,Fduring the afternoon. Warmer than
OL,17,FTuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
